  "category": "坚持奋斗",
  "total": 7,
  "quotes": [
    {
      "id": 11,
      "content": "我们一定要坚持下去，一定要不断地工作。",
      "source": "愚公移山",
      "date": "一九四五年六月十一日",
      "category": "坚持奋斗",
      "articleUrl": "https://redwisdom.xyz/reading.html#083-%E6%84%9A%E5%85%AC%E7%A7%BB%E5%B1%B1.md",
      "sourceMatch": "catalog-title"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "content": "斗争，失败，再斗争，再失败，再斗争，直至胜利——这就是人民的逻辑，他们也是决不会违背这个逻辑的。",
      "source": "丢掉幻想，准备斗争",
      "date": "一九四九年八月十四日",
      "category": "坚持奋斗",
      "articleUrl": "https://redwisdom.xyz/reading.html#154-%E4%B8%A2%E6%8E%89%E5%B9%BB%E6%83%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E6%96%97%E4%BA%89.md",
      "sourceMatch": "catalog-title"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "content": "世上无难事，只要肯登攀。",
      "source": "水调歌头·重上井冈山",
      "date": "一九六五年五月",
      "category": "坚持奋斗",
      "articleUrl": null,
      "sourceMatch": "unmatched"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "content": "雄关漫道真如铁，而今迈步从头越。",
      "source": "忆秦娥·娄山关",
      "date": "一九三五年二月",
      "category": "坚持奋斗",
      "articleUrl": null,
      "sourceMatch": "unmatched"
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "content": "我们的阵地，只能一个一个地夺取，我们的力量，只能一点一点地聚集。",
      "source": "星星之火，可以燎原",
      "date": "一九三○年一月五日",
      "category": "坚持奋斗",
      "articleUrl": "https://redwisdom.xyz/reading.html#005-%E6%98%9F%E6%98%9F%E4%B9%8B%E7%81%AB%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%87%8E%E5%8E%9F.md",
      "sourceMatch": "catalog-title"
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "content": "一万年太久，只争朝夕。",
      "source": "满江红·和郭沫若同志",
      "date": "一九六三年一月九日",
      "category": "坚持奋斗",
      "articleUrl": null,
      "sourceMatch": "unmatched"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "content": "做一件事，无论大小，倘无恒心，是很不好的。",
      "source": "反对本本主义",
      "date": "一九三○年五月",
      "category": "坚持奋斗",
      "articleUrl": "https://redwisdom.xyz/reading.html#006-%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E6%9C%AC%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%BB%E4%B9%89.md",
      "sourceMatch": "catalog-title"
    }
  ]
}
